},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T05:47:03-08:00","id":1278293,"title":"","content":"There's a major difference in audio level between the two hosts of this podcast (Logan's audio was much louder than Chazz's): I had to max-out my volume to hear Chazz, then drop it again for Logan. It got a bit difficult when I would crank it up to hear Chazz's perspective, then <span style=\"font-size:16px\">LOGAN WOULD VERY EMPHATICALLY AGREE</span> and I would scramble to drop my volume, only to have <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Chazz offer an insightful comment.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","user":"Ashnak","date":".  Edit: Corrected spelling of Chazz's name 01-03-2019, 10:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23791-ashnak","name":"Ashnak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T06:01:48-08:00","id":1278297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ashnak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1274860-podcast-coverage-of-scion?p=1278293#post1278293\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a major difference in audio level between the two hosts of this podcast (Logan's audio was much louder than Chaz's): I had to max-out my volume to hear Chaz, then drop it again for Logan. It got a bit difficult when I would crank it up to hear Chaz's perspective, then <span style=\"font-size:16px\">LOGAN WOULD VERY EMPHATICALLY AGREE</span> and I would scramble to drop my volume, only to have <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Chaz offer an insightful comment.</span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sorry about that, it's my fault. One of my audio settings got messed up on my end for recording. We did the best we could to equalize the volume but didn't want to lose the episode. I've fixed the issue for future recordings and you won't experience the same issue in other episodes. -Chazz","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T00:02:44-08:00","id":1278510,"title":"","content":"Chazz, problem was even in 1st Scion podcast - I find that I can clearly heard you co-host in my car or phone - I can only hear you when using car audio, as you speak too quiet ( or record ). In 2nd podcast it's just much more prominent then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T04:14:47-08:00","id":1278539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1274860-podcast-coverage-of-scion?p=1278510#post1278510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Chazz, problem was even in 1st Scion podcast - I find that I can clearly heard you co-host in my car or phone - I can only hear you when using car audio, as you speak too quiet ( or record ). In 2nd podcast it's just much more prominent then.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, we just had the same issue in both episodes. It's worse in the second because I was leaning back. Next episode will be better (as will any of the episodes in the backlog). We do have one more audio track recorded which will be coming sometime in February, but I'm going to try to get fancy to balance out the audio.<br /> <br /> Thanks for sticking with us!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u